{
  "summary": "This experiment tested an RNA-only model using the scvi_n200 encoder with avgpool aggregation, building on the previous PCA-based baseline (config_001). Validation accuracy of 0.5203 and F1 score of 0.4982 suggest improved performance compared to the PCA baseline, indicating potential value in the scvi_n200 encoder and avgpool aggregation. However, the impact of alternative encoders or aggregation methods remains uncertain due to limited comparative evidence, and further experiments are needed to isolate their individual effects."
}

